        "text_qwegdy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Travel light! This baby carrier is compact, easy to carry, and takes you where a stroller can't go. Adventure awaits — ready to go?</p><p>Whether soaking up the sun on the beach or strolling through historic streets, the <strong>MARQUE</strong> baby carrier is our vacation essential. No more bulky strollers, make way for limitless exploration!</p><ul><li>Explore the world with ease</li><li>Lighten your load</li><li>From city streets to rugged trails, nothing can stop you</li><li>Experience freedom</li></ul>",
